downloading any season's full data.

\code{load_wnba_stats_game_rosters_manifest()} returns the
per-season manifest CSV (\code{season}, \code{row_count}, \code{generated_at_utc},
\code{source_endpoint}) for the WNBA Stats game rosters release tag without
downloading any season's full data.

\code{load_wnba_stats_officials_manifest()} returns the per-season
manifest CSV (\code{season}, \code{row_count}, \code{generated_at_utc},
\code{source_endpoint}) for the WNBA Stats officials release tag without
downloading any season's full data.

\code{load_wnba_stats_player_game_logs_manifest()} returns the
per-season manifest CSV (\code{season}, \code{row_count}, \code{generated_at_utc},
\code{source_endpoint}) for the WNBA Stats player game logs release tag
without downloading any season's full data.

\code{load_wnba_stats_schedule_manifest()} returns the per-season
manifest CSV (\code{season}, \code{row_count}, \code{generated_at_utc},
\code{source_endpoint}) for the WNBA Stats schedules release tag without
downloading any season's full data.

\code{load_wnba_stats_pbp_manifest()} returns the per-season
manifest CSV (\code{season}, \code{row_count}, \code{generated_at_utc},
\code{source_endpoint}) for the WNBA Stats play-by-play release tag without
downloading any season's full data.

Loads possession-level data derived from the WNBA Stats API
play-by-play -- one row per possession, with the on-court 5-man lineups
for both teams, shooting/rebounding/turnover splits, and the possession
start type. Backed by the \code{wehoop-wnba-stats-data} pipeline that reads
raw JSONs from \code{wehoop-wnba-stats-raw} and publishes csv.gz/parquet/rds
artifacts to the \code{wnba_stats_possessions} release tag.
}
